  "content": "[[File:1301.png|right]] \n13.01\n\n==The Skullcrusher Orcs==\n\nRegion: [[The Grey Mountains]]\n\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">Connects to</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\";mso-bidi-font-family: \"TimesNewRoman\";color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">: 11.03, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">14.00</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\";mso-bidi-font-family: \"TimesNewRoman\";color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\";color:black; mso-themecolor:text1\">16.16.06</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:\"CenturyGothic\",\"sans-serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\"; mso-bidi-font-family:\"TimesNewRoman\";color:black;mso-themecolor:text1\"> and 43.08. </span></p>\n\n==Overview==\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;\">[[The Weeper]]'s daughter arranged for the [[Skullcrusher orcs]], then children, to be cared for in this secluded mountain valley within [[The Marche of the Winterjarl|the Winterjarl's marche]]. They live here still and create sturdy and elegant woodwork.</p>\n[[Category:Hex]]\n[[Category:The Grey Mountains]]\n[[Category:The Marche of the Winterjarl]]",
